Package: fanctl
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Advanced Linux fan control daemon and TUI client
 fanctl provides a daemon (fanctld) to dynamically control fan speeds
 based on hardware temperature sensors and customizable curves,
 along with an interactive TUI client for configuration and monitoring.
